  "details": "I would like to have a setting that allows me to limit the number of friends who do not speak the same language as me.\n\nI am Japanese and not confident in my English, but there have been times when I was speaking with only Japanese speakers, and an English-speaking friend joined where I was and I had to respond in English and could not speak with the other Japanese speakers.\n\nI feel that Japanese people tend to speak poor English and want to talk only with Japanese speakers, but tend to panic when people who cannot speak Japanese join them.\n\nI believe that VRChat has the potential to communicate beyond geographical restrictions and language barriers, and that the problem of communication that cannot be understood because of language barriers is a troublesome issue.\n\nIf possible, we would like to see a function that allows us to switch so that only people who have set the same language as the user we want to Join can Join.",
